{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1365986-starting-equipment-for-psion-characters-aeon","id":1365986,"title":"Starting Equipment for Psion characters (Aeon)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-02-07T05:34:36-08:00","id":1365986,"title":"Starting Equipment for Psion characters (Aeon)","content":"Character creation doesn't include any starting gear so what should I use to decide what my PC's ought to have, if anything? Do I give them all guns? Do they all have computers?<br /> Thanks","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25906-ghost-whistler","name":"ghost whistler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25906_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T05:49:20-08:00","id":1365990,"title":"","content":"Look at their wealth edge and paths and let them have what seems appropriate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T06:01:15-08:00","id":1365993,"title":"","content":"Everybody has a computer in Aeon era, even the poorest.<br /> <br /> As Florin said, you should give the equipment they would have for the paths they have, and allow them to buy anything that their wealth fit. Any other equipment should need a pretty good explanation.<br /> <br /> About weapons, I would say they will need a path to have them, and the more paths they have related to guns, the bigger the weapon they have access. Let\u2019s say Military Brat, Combat Specialist and Legion paths combined will give access to about any gun they want.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T08:18:06-08:00","id":1366025,"title":"","content":"What about for Aeon agents? What would they have?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25906-ghost-whistler","name":"ghost whistler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25906_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T09:15:43-08:00","id":1366044,"title":"","content":"Depends what they do for Aeon. Humanitarian workers would have medical supplies, probably some kind of hazmat protection, things like that. Interstellar explorers would have space suits, scientific equipment, and probably access to non-ballistic personal defense weapons.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T11:44:52-08:00","id":1366080,"title":"","content":"You get common sense access to gear from the Access portion of your Paths. Things that would be reasonable you just have, and if you need to do a special requisition you can roll on your path for it, or one of the various specialized edges that do it without rolling like Legion Armory.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-07T12:31:18-08:00","id":1366090,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ghost whistler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1365986-starting-equipment-for-psion-characters-aeon#post1365986\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Character creation doesn't include any starting gear so what should I use to decide what my PC's ought to have, if anything? Do I give them all guns? Do they all have computers?<br /> Thanks</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;You\u2019 don\u2019t have to \u2018give\u2019 them anything. Let them come up with what they want their character to have and see if it\u2019s reasonable for their concept.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-08T11:40:11-08:00","id":1366360,"title":"","content":"Also be careful with formatting tolerance, I missed it the first time I went through the rules.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1635-citadel97501","name":"Citadel97501","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"544"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-17T13:06:31-08:00","id":1368623,"title":"","content":"I was actually thinking about this topic the other day in regards to starting equipment and psion-only bioware such as an IAD. Those things require three dots of Wealth. Should someone with Wealth 3 be able to get one automatically? Would they need Wealth 4 and then get effectively downgraded to Wealth 3 for the first session? You could also work for Orgotech and take the Bioware Access Edge.<br /> <br /> Pretty much any PC is going to have a Path associated with 'adventuring', so practically everyone qualifies for at least one weapon. If you're a Psion, it even makes sense for your weapon to be formattable bioware, but would you count an IAD as a valid path associated 'weapon' to give out for free?<br /> <br /> On the pro side, a thief should be allowed to start with an array of potentially expensive (and possibly illegal) B&amp;E tools, a hacker should have a custom computer setup worth thousands of dollars, and a getaway driver should have a vehicle that performs like something out of the Indy-500, so anyone with a psionic Path should presumably be allowed to start with an IAD, since it is appropriate for their chosen background and in line with the expensive equipment assumed to be owned by characters from other Paths.<br /> <br /> On the con side, it is pretty expensive, and this means the default assumption for practically every psion is that they'll start with a 'free' IAD, as if the Psi orders hand them out to everyone stepping out of a Prometheus Chamber, which makes the entire experience of getting one far less special. This also logically penalizes people for playing Psiads, since it is hard to justify starting with an IAD when your character presumably has never even seen a Prometheus Chamber and does their best to avoid the Psi orders.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-17T13:28:28-08:00","id":1368629,"title":"","content":"That's why I worded my response as &quot;look at their paths and edges.&quot; Anything requiring Wealth is not going to just come free from a path, it requires Wealth. So, IADs are not going to be handed out like candy. As you noted the Bioware Access edge works. I also have handed them out from time to time in-game as load-outs for the Legion Armory edge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-17T14:02:27-08:00","id":1368635,"title":"","content":"If you prefer, just treat as Wealth the sum of the relevant Paths and the wealth edge. For a L item I would require at least 8, otherwise just a simple sum.<br /> <br /> Having the item doesn\u2019t mean the character bought, it means the character can use it when need without asking anyone, like a company car or the company lap top. So if the access to the path is limited, he may need to return the item until the status is back to normal. of course the character don\u2019t need to return just because used the path twice, but don\u2019t expect a replacement or repair until everything is ok.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}